WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.152
Care work starts with people. Meet CareSys. It helps agencies organize the day, while caregivers stay in control of their careers.

2
00:00:11.152 --> 00:00:23.768
Your experience matters. Build a profile that reflects your skills, the languages you speak, and where you'd like to work. Helpful examples guide you along the way.

3
00:00:23.768 --> 00:00:36.072
Looking for your next team member? Explore approved profiles, manage applications, and invite candidates. Each person chooses how they'd like to respond.

4
00:00:36.072 --> 00:00:45.400
Your career story is yours to share. Choose which history to disclose, who can see it, and how long access lasts.

5
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:55.880
When it's time to join a team, clear decisions matter. Review the contract version, record agreement, and give separate permission to join.

6
00:00:55.880 --> 00:01:07.800
Bring the daily plan together. Assign visits, check availability and qualifications, and keep care notes and incident records where the team can review them.

7
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:19.456
Make time reviews easier to follow. Record online clock events and breaks, then review worked time and correction requests with a clear record of decisions.

8
00:01:19.456 --> 00:01:35.264
Keep agency operations connected. Track expenses, equipment, invoices, and receipts. Export approved worked time for the next payroll step. External payroll submission is still planned.

9
00:01:35.264 --> 00:01:45.960
Today, CareSys has a working local web application. Android and iPhone apps, regional pricing, and commercial hosting are on the roadmap.

10
00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:57.160
Ready to explore CareSys? Take a closer look and discuss a pilot for your agency. Support your team, with people at the heart of the work.
